      "widgets_values": [
        "GUIDED UNIT REFERENCE GENERATOR\n\nThis is text-driven, but intentionally not prompt-only: MistoLine holds a repeatable three-quarter profile and IP-Adapter supplies low-strength style guidance.\n\nTo switch class, load the infantry guide and replace the unit phrase in Positive. Keep the view/style clauses.\n\nThe diffusion image is generated at native 1024. BiRefNet removes the white background, then UnitReferenceTwoTone guarantees exactly two Pixel1 subject colors plus alpha. The 128 file is a review copy; feed the 1024 transparent result into Unit Sprite - Flat Key 128 for the canonical game layer."
      ],
      "title": "How to use"
    }
